'''Suntan Cat''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] added in [[Version 9.8 Update|Version 9.8]]. The summer variant of [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Cat]], he can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Gals of Summer Sunshine (Gacha Event)|Gals of Summer Sunshine]]/[[Gals of Summer Blue Ocean (Gacha Event)|Blue Ocean]] gacha events. Prior to [[Version 13.5 Update|Version 13.5]], he could be obtained from the [[Gals of Summer (Removed Gacha Event)|Gals of Summer]] gacha event. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 11.7 Update|Version 11.7]] increases his health and speed.

